                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a Proteus with this upgrade is on the table, at the start of any of the controlling player&apos;s turns, before any Reserve rolls ar emoade, they may declare that the Proteus&apos; auguries are being used in Disruption or Relay modes, their effect lasting until their next player turn. If a Land Raider Proteus is fitted with an Explorator Augury Web, its transport capacity is reduced to eight models. Distruption Mode: The opposing force sufers -1 to their Reserve Rolls in the next player turn. Relay Mode: The controlling player&apos;s Reserve rolls may be re-rolled (Whether failed or successful) if they wish.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
